cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the released models, please cite the paper."
title: "Using Human Feedback to Fine-Tune Implicit 3D Face Geometry"
abstract: >-
  Code and released models for fine-tuning the 3D geometry of EG3D, a 3D-aware
  GAN, from a geometry-sensitive reward model trained on human preference
  rankings.
authors:
  - family-names: Moore
    given-names: Archer P.
  - family-names: Gong
    given-names: Mingming
  - family-names: Hodgkinson
    given-names: Liam
date-released: "2026-06-26"
url: "https://github.com/apmoore499/eg3d-rlhf-geometry"
repository-code: "https://github.com/apmoore499/eg3d-rlhf-geometry"
license-url: "https://github.com/apmoore499/eg3d-rlhf-geometry/blob/main/LICENSE.txt"
keywords:
  - EG3D
  - 3D-aware GAN
  - neural radiance fields
  - RLHF
  - 3D face geometry
